.TH CRYPTO 3 "2026" "y-- standard library" "y-- Library Reference"
.SH NAME
Crypto \- Cryptographic hash functions
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B Crypto
module provides essential cryptographic hashing algorithms:
.B MD5, SHA1, SHA256, SHA3, Keccak, DoubleSHA256.
.SH FUNCTIONS
.SS MD5
.TP
\fBSYNOPSIS\fR
string() MD5(data: string())
.TP
\fBDESCRIPTION\fR
Computes the MD5 hash digest of the input string.

.SS SHA1
.TP
\fBSYNOPSIS\fR
string() SHA1(data: string())
.TP
\fBDESCRIPTION\fR
Computes the SHA-1 hash digest of the input string.

.SS SHA256
.TP
\fBSYNOPSIS\fR
string() SHA256(data: string())
.TP
\fBDESCRIPTION\fR
Computes the SHA-256 hash digest of the input string.

.SS SHA3
.TP
\fBSYNOPSIS\fR
string() SHA3(data: string())
.TP
\fBDESCRIPTION\fR
Computes the SHA-3 hash digest of the input string.

.SS Keccak
.TP
\fBSYNOPSIS\fR
string() Keccak(data: string())
.TP
\fBDESCRIPTION\fR
Computes the Keccak hash digest of the input string.

.SS DoubleSHA256
.TP
\fBSYNOPSIS\fR
string() DoubleSHA256(data: string())
.TP
\fBDESCRIPTION\fR
Computes double SHA-256 hash digest of the input string.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
Json(3), Http(3)
